Task #4: Pipeline Closure, Certificates & Admin Dashboard

Schema Changes:
- Added Milestone, AdminAction, Certificate, ProjectRating, Dispute, MilestoneTag models
- Extended Engagement with full state machine (negotiating→pending_deposit→active→closing→closed→archived)
- Added project payment fields (projectValueBdt, platformFeeRate, depositAmountBdt, netStudentPayoutBdt)
- Added namedContactPhone/Email, agreedAt, depositConfirmedAt, completedAt, closedAt
- Added standingBadge field to Profile (green/yellow/red/banned)
- Added @@unique([engagementId, raterId]) on ProjectRating

API Routes Created:
- POST /api/engagements/[id]/close - Admin quality check with AdminAction logging
- POST /api/engagements/[id]/release-payment - Payment release + certificate generation in DB transaction
- GET/POST /api/engagements/[id]/rate - Tag-based rating with 7-21 day window
- GET /api/certificates/[certId] - Public certificate data (no auth)
- GET/POST /api/admin/payment-queue - Deposit confirmation queue
- GET /api/admin/review-watch - Milestone review deadline tracking
- GET/POST /api/admin/dispute-queue - Dispute resolution with ruling form
- GET /api/admin/closure-queue - Project closure queue
- GET /api/admin/transaction-log - Append-only payment transaction log
- GET/POST /api/admin/standing-badge - Company standing badge management

UI Changes:
- Admin dashboard: 6 new tabs (Payment Queue, Review Watch, Dispute Queue, Closure Queue, Transaction Log, Standing Badges)
- /verify/[certId] - Public certificate verification page (no login required)
- Student profile: Certificate badges with verification links
- Profile API returns certificate data

Trust Score:
- Spec formula: completion_rate*0.40 + on_time_rate*0.30 + positive_tag_ratio*0.20 + log(avg_value)/10*0.10
- Updated on payment release

Also fixed pre-existing TypeScript errors (unknown→ReactNode) in profile and problems pages.

